# Pi extension dependencies. Each extension has its own
# package.json + node_modules; the host driver process loads them
# at runtime via jiti. Only check in package.json + lockfile;
# `make install-deps` (and bake-image.sh for in-sandbox
# extensions) recreate node_modules.
extensions/*/node_modules/

